/-!
The prime table is checked in order. For consecutive entries, trial
division through a fixed gcd checks that both the next entry and every
intervening composite are labeled correctly. A second modulus contains
every listed prime and certifies the larger primes of the form p²−2.
Finally a short index chooses the summand with the nested prime condition.
-/
